1
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:14,700
Hurry and back up!

2
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:15,560
Move it!

3
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:18,040
Want me to widen the road so you can take off?

4
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:18,960
Keep backing in!

5
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,080
Watch your mouth!

6
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,580
Mind your own business and hurry up!

7
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:22,600
If you don't know how to park, don't!

8
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,580
Keep barking orders and I'll beat you up!

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:25,900
Try me.

10
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,180
Knock it off!

11
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:28,660
Two of you, get over here!

12
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:31,100
Boot this car, plate Jian A95887!

13
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:34,300
Just kidding, man!

14
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:35,040
I was just joking.

15
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,020
Can a guy who directs parking

16
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:39,340
really control the bidding?

17
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:40,140
What was that about just now?

18
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,500
I lost my temper. My bad.

19
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:44,060
Besides Jinxin Company, the tip-off letter

20
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:45,860
also mentioned another person:

21
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:47,520
a man named Zhao Yong.

22
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,420
We looked into him.

23
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:49,240
He's

24
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:51,940
a guard at Jianzhou Public Resource Trading Center.

25
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,320
His bank statements aren't clean.

26
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,920
Two million in cash was deposited this past year.

27
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:58,420
We suspect that he

28
00:00:58,680 --> 00:00:59,840
assisted the bidding agency,

29
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:01,080
leaked bid information,

30
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,200
took bribes,

31
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,280
and colluded in the bidding.

32
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:06,220
A security guard with that much clout?

33
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:07,580
He's really not to be underestimated.

34
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:10,460
Summon Zhao Yong.

35
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:11,560
Keep it confidential.

36
00:01:12,940 --> 00:01:13,660
I'm heading out, then.

37
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:14,100
See you later.

38
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:14,700
See you tomorrow.

39
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,560
Zhao Yong, right?

40
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:20,060
Who are you?

41
00:02:20,580 --> 00:02:22,320
Jianzhou PSB Economic Crime Investigation Detachment.

42
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:27,960
Easy, take it easy!

43
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,040
My suit is white!

44
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:30,980
You are being officially summoned under the law.

45
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:32,000
Come with us.

46
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:34,160
Explain the two million in your account.

47
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:35,720
Where did it come from?

48
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:38,060
I worked as a security guard there.

49
00:02:39,980 --> 00:02:41,900
Making barely 4,000 yuan a month.

50
00:02:42,740 --> 00:02:43,860
What does that even cover?

51
00:02:44,740 --> 00:02:45,540
That day,

52
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:48,340
it was the first time anyone gave me that much cash.

53
00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:49,820
Stacks upon stacks of it.

54
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:51,880
I was completely stunned.

55
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,020
Officers,

56
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:55,240
I'll confess.

57
00:02:56,300 --> 00:02:57,700
Please go easy on me.

58
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:01,420
You've watched quite a few legal awareness videos, huh?

59
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:02,900
I was terrified.

60
00:03:03,220 --> 00:03:06,000
Whenever I came across legal videos online,

61
00:03:06,660 --> 00:03:07,380
I would watch them.

62
00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:11,140
I want to apply for major meritorious service.

63
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:12,380
Whether you get that credit

64
00:03:12,380 --> 00:03:13,640
comes down to how you perform,

65
00:03:13,940 --> 00:03:14,980
and whether you cooperate.

66
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:17,060
The ball is entirely in your court.

67
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:19,260
I'll cooperate! Absolutely!

68
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,180
Officers,

69
00:03:20,780 --> 00:03:22,200
that Jinxin Company...

70
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:24,700
There's definitely something seriously wrong there.

71
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,320
Zhao Yong also mentioned

72
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,780
that Jinxin Company might have major issues.

73
00:03:32,820 --> 00:03:33,660
What do you think?

74
00:03:39,020 --> 00:03:39,500
Team Leader,

75
00:03:39,780 --> 00:03:40,260
Captain Lin,

76
00:03:41,060 --> 00:03:41,960
Yao Yang is awake.

77
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:46,460
By the time the project reached me, it was fourth-hand.

78
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,880
Each tier took a cut off the top.

79
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:52,260
They feast on the meat,

80
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:54,420
while we can't even get a sip of soup.

81
00:03:54,820 --> 00:03:56,420
Through legitimate bidding,

82
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,760
you can't land any project at all.

83
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:00,860
One time,

84
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:03,060
Zhao Yong had too much to drink

85
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:05,280
and brought up Jinxin Company.

86
00:04:05,780 --> 00:04:07,220
I went to pay my respects,

87
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:10,780
but I couldn't even get through their door.

88
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:13,980
Compared to people like that,

89
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:16,600
we're just ants in society.

90
00:04:17,980 --> 00:04:19,340
No connections,

91
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:21,320
no backing.

92
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,300
In the end,

93
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:28,260
we're left to take the fall.

94
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,880
Calm down.

95
00:04:31,780 --> 00:04:33,060
I want to know,

96
00:04:33,460 --> 00:04:34,780
for a case from four years ago,

97
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,680
why report it only now?

98
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:39,720
And in such an extreme way?

99
00:04:41,460 --> 00:04:42,420
A couple of days ago,

100
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:44,860
I went somewhere

101
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:47,740
and ran into a few folks from my hometown.

102
00:05:02,620 --> 00:05:03,600
This man, Yao Yang,

103
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,240
really had it rough.

104
00:05:06,540 --> 00:05:07,880
His family was torn apart.

105
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,720
How much of what he said

106
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:16,620
do you believe?

107
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:21,140
I still trust the evidence more.

108
00:05:21,460 --> 00:05:23,500
Without an investigation, we have no say.

109
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:25,820
Let's go take a look.

110
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,900
Lin Lan and I visited the site where Yao Yang's hometown folks work.

111
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:40,680
The workers all said

112
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:43,020
Yao Yang never withheld their pay.

113
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,300
Even when his daughter had leukemia

114
00:05:45,460 --> 00:05:46,720
and desperately needed medical funds,

115
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:49,140
he still paid everyone in full.

116
00:05:49,500 --> 00:05:50,800
The shoddy construction

117
00:05:50,860 --> 00:05:52,600
is just what has surfaced.

118
00:05:53,140 --> 00:05:54,540
We must look past the surface

119
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,800
to expose what lies behind the subcontracts:

120
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:59,140
an intricate, corrupt web of interests.

121
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,560
Yao Yang

122
00:06:00,780 --> 00:06:01,860
has a criminal track record;

123
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,440
his guilt cannot be erased.

124
00:06:04,060 --> 00:06:06,240
Yet he still has a shred of conscience.

125
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,560
If even he is speaking out,

126
00:06:09,180 --> 00:06:10,080
his voice

127
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,820
is calling out to us.

128
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,400
I'm starting to believe what Yao Yang said.

129
00:06:16,180 --> 00:06:17,340
Yao Yang's allegations

130
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,260
mostly hold up.

131
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:22,180
Zhao Yong's testimony

132
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,180
also points to Jinxin Company.

133
00:06:26,060 --> 00:06:27,660
Putting the two together...

134
00:06:34,180 --> 00:06:34,500
Hello?

135
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,220
Yanyan.

136
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:37,820
Uncle Geng, I need urgent help!

137
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,320
I can't reach my dad.

138
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,880
Can you come to my school?

139
00:06:41,180 --> 00:06:42,220
Sure, I'll be right there.

140
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,760
What are you doing here?

141
00:07:07,100 --> 00:07:08,440
Didn't Yanyan say you weren't coming?

142
00:07:11,900 --> 00:07:13,260
It's my daughter's performance.

143
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:14,720
How could I miss it?

144
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,640
Look at my genes.

145
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,080
Aren't they great?

146
00:07:24,980 --> 00:07:25,980
Yanyan is smart.

147
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,780
Come on, jump forward, jump forward!

148
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:39,040
Jump forward, jump, jump, jump!

149
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:40,520
Hurry, hurry!

150
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:41,580
Hurry up, hurry up!

151
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:42,460
Move forward!

152
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:43,920
Keep going!

153
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:50,280
Uncle Geng, you're so clumsy!

154
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:53,520
You're not as good as my dad. So silly!

155
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:56,460
Yanyan.

156
00:07:57,660 --> 00:07:59,540
I'm no match for your dad at video games.

157
00:07:59,980 --> 00:08:01,860
Back then, at the arcades in Jianzhou,

158
00:08:02,060 --> 00:08:03,160
your dad was the undisputed champion.

159
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:05,580
He defeated every challenger.

160
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:07,740
Do you know what else he was good at,

161
00:08:08,020 --> 00:08:08,740
besides playing games?

162
00:08:08,740 --> 00:08:10,860
I know, my dad's great at fighting!

163
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:12,980
Back then, you and Dad fought those thugs

164
00:08:12,980 --> 00:08:14,340
and got commended by the city!

165
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:16,660
My dad even took a knife for you!

166
00:08:17,100 --> 00:08:19,220
I've heard that story hundreds of times.

167
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:21,800
Yanyan, come have some watermelon!

168
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:22,940
Thank you, Grandma!

169
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:28,020
Yanyan is really well-behaved.

170
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,040
You raised her so well.

171
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:32,500
Yeah.

172
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:36,700
Proves getting that divorce was the right call.

173
00:08:46,980 --> 00:08:47,780
Qingbo,

174
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:50,660
if there are things

175
00:08:50,940 --> 00:08:52,020
we did wrong,

176
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,960
we can actually find a way to make amends.

177
00:08:58,500 --> 00:08:59,820
What do you mean?

178
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:13,540
I...

179
00:09:14,260 --> 00:09:15,780
Why I got divorced back then—

180
00:09:15,780 --> 00:09:16,900
it's not like you don't know.

181
00:09:17,260 --> 00:09:18,580
I didn't do anything wrong.

182
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:20,660
She thought I was too poor

183
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,160
and abandoned Yanyan and me.

184
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,720
You've said that hundreds of times.

185
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:27,160
In front of Yanyan,

186
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,300
let's drop the subject.

187
00:09:29,460 --> 00:09:30,340
Another round.

188
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,660
Maybe I'll win this time.

189
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,380
No way.

190
00:09:54,540 --> 00:09:55,380
Secretary Luo,

191
00:09:56,380 --> 00:09:58,700
That covers the basic findings

192
00:09:58,700 --> 00:10:00,620
of our police investigation.

193
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:04,780
I also have one more thing to report to you.

194
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:07,260
Comrade Geng Qing has strong professional skills.

195
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:10,300
I'm not worried about his integrity.

196
00:10:11,020 --> 00:10:13,240
I just worry someone might set a trap for him,

197
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,880
try to bribe him, and if he isn't careful...

198
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:17,060
All his phone calls with Du Qingbo,

199
00:10:17,180 --> 00:10:18,260
private contact,

200
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:20,160
and what they talked about in person,

201
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:22,120
he reports everything to me right away.

202
00:10:24,060 --> 00:10:25,140
Geng Qing's father

203
00:10:25,220 --> 00:10:27,360
was a provincial model worker at our Second Chemical Plant.

204
00:10:27,660 --> 00:10:28,940
When Geng Qing was eleven,

205
00:10:29,620 --> 00:10:31,060
an accident occurred at the chemical plant.

206
00:10:31,660 --> 00:10:33,900
His father saved four people,

207
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:37,020
but after rushing into the flames a fifth time,

208
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,340
he never came back out.

209
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:43,520
Ever since he was a kid, he has had that drive in him.

210
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:46,220
He wants to be a good man like his father.

211
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:48,120
He won't let down everyone's

212
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,960
trust and care for him.

213
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:52,020
Geng Qing won't stray from the right path.

214
00:10:52,860 --> 00:10:55,100
He's also the best choice for this case.

215
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:59,080
I believe in Comrade Geng Qing.

216
00:11:03,420 --> 00:11:04,220
Secretary Luo,

217
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:06,020
I understand.

218
00:11:51,040 --> 00:11:53,240
This is what I promised you.

219
00:11:53,980 --> 00:11:55,100
You keep your word.

220
00:11:55,380 --> 00:11:56,480
You have principles.

221
00:11:57,780 --> 00:12:00,540
If you run into any trouble, just let me know.

222
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:03,160
Helping the people solve their problems

223
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:05,300
is my duty, after all.

224
00:12:05,500 --> 00:12:08,100
There'll be plenty more times I'll need your help.

225
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,840
Give me the amount we agreed on,

226
00:12:11,020 --> 00:12:12,040
and I'll approve the project for you.

227
00:12:12,380 --> 00:12:13,140
I wouldn't lie to you.

228
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,280
Why would I lie to you?

229
00:12:18,700 --> 00:12:20,520
You're terrible, Professor Gong.
